  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>G</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>g</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo> </mo><mi>mA</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math>.</p><p>Let's consider the following figure:</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/a0aa2f20-f1af-4f18-bd84-2fe489844320.png\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 163px;\"/></p><p>From the figure, we have</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>g</mi></msub><mi>G</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>g</mi></msub></mrow></mfenced><mi>S</mi><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>⇒</mo><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>g</mi></msub><mi>G</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>g</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>⇒</mo><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>003</mn></mrow></mfrac><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>75</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></math></p>",
